Date: Mon, 08 Aug 2022 21:34:49 +0000
Subject: Re: [unmarked] Re: Dynamic parameters in multi-season occupancy models
Message-ID: <1WwomQMobCc.iW-7IxpbAgAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
